X:1
T:Comfort, Comfort Ye My People
T:Psalm 42 tune (words: Isaiah 40) · GENEVAN 42 (PSALM 42 / FREU DICH SEHR)
C:Music: Louis Bourgeois, Genevan Psalter, 1551 · Words: Johannes Olearius, 1671; tr. Catherine Winkworth, 1863
S:Melody (Genevan rhythm) checked against the printed Common Service Book of the Lutheran Church (1918) #8 (hymnary.org page scan): phrase-ending notes are half notes, as printed. Also matches the Open Hymnal ABC note for note. Words: Winkworth, 1863 (public domain).
M:3/2
L:1/4
Q:1/2=60
K:F
